  "path": "Act02_Chapter01/Act02_Chapter01_Trial13",
  "events": [
    {"op": "GosubResetWitchBook", "line": 1, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "System/System_ResetWitchBook", "Version": 6}},
    {"op": "SetCustomVariable", "line": 2, "indent": 0, "params": {"Expression": "isReenact = true"}},
    {"op": "ModifyTextPrinter", "line": 3, "indent": 0, "params": {"Duration": 0.0, "Lazy": 0, "IdAndAppearance": "Normal.Simple", "MakeDefault": 1, "HideOther": 1}},
    {"op": "Gosub", "line": 4, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "System/System_Subroutine.BeginAdv"}},
    {"op": "label", "name": "Judge6-13-1", "line": 11, "indent": 0},
    {"op": "ModifyBackgroundExtended", "line": 13, "indent": 0, "params": {"TintColor": "#000000", "Duration": 1.2000000476837158, "Lazy": 0, "AppearanceAndTransition": "Transparent", "SubId": "Overlay"}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 14, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "1.8"}},
    {"op": "PlayBgm", "line": 17, "indent": 0, "params": {"BgmPath": "Bgm_19_1", "Volume": 1.0, "Loop": 1, "FadeInDuration": 0.0}},
    {"op": "SpawnExtended", "line": 21, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "Reenact_Ch02_E01_S01", "Wait": 0}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 22, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "1.5"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 24, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "因为她太美好了。<br>\n闪耀夺目，温暖人心……", "AuthorId": "Margo", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Trial13_Margo001"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 26, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "所以啊……我就杀了她。<br>\n仅此而已。……就是这么一回事。", "AuthorId": "Margo", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Trial13_Margo002"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 28, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "至于杀害她的方法……<br>\n我是从可可的语音备忘录里得知的。", "AuthorId": "Margo", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Trial13_Margo003"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 30, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "这座监牢的地下保险箱里，<br>\n存放着能杀死魔女的药物，还有能用作凶器的武器。", "AuthorId": "Margo", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Trial13_Margo004"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 32, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "所以我就把那些东西拿走了。<br>\n因为那里根本没人看管，只要知道打开保险箱的方法，<br>\n一切都轻而易举。", "AuthorId": "Margo", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Trial13_Margo005"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 34, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "不过，谁知道会发生什么呢。<br>\n说不定会被典狱长或者看守阻挠。", "AuthorId": "Margo", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Trial13_Margo006"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 36, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "为了发泄我心中郁积的这份情感，<br>\n我想要做好万全的准备。", "AuthorId": "Margo", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Trial13_Margo007"]}},
    {"op": "ResetText", "line": 38, "indent": 0, "params": {}},
    {"op": "DestroySpawnedExtended", "line": 39, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "Reenact_Ch02_E01_S01", "Wait": 0, "LogWarning": 1}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 40, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "1.5"}},
    {"op": "SpawnExtended", "line": 44, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "Reenact_Ch02_E01_S02", "Wait": 0}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 45, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "1.5"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 47, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "首先，我把希罗打昏了。<br>\n我用手套装着从中庭里挖来的沙子，<br>\n朝着她的后脑勺狠狠地来了一下……", "AuthorId": "Margo", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Trial13_Margo008"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 49, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "不过跟虚构作品的情节不同，那样做<br>\n有可能直接导致她死亡……", "AuthorId": "Margo", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Trial13_Margo009"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 51, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "不过，那已经无所谓了。", "AuthorId": "Margo", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Trial13_Margo010"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 53, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "如此将身处诺亚房间内的希罗打晕之后……<br>\n我就喊梅露露过来了。", "AuthorId": "Margo", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Trial13_Margo011"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 55, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "我跟她说希罗倒下了，她就立刻赶来了。<br>\n多么善良的好孩子啊……♡", "AuthorId": "Margo", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Trial13_Margo012"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 57, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "梅露露一看到希罗，<br>\n就立刻跑到她身边了。", "AuthorId": "Margo", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Trial13_Margo013"]}},
    {"op": "ResetText", "line": 59, "indent": 0, "params": {}},
    {"op": "DestroySpawnedExtended", "line": 60, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "Reenact_Ch02_E01_S02", "Wait": 0, "LogWarning": 1}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 61, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "1.5"}},
    {"op": "SpawnExtended", "line": 67, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "Reenact_Ch02_E01_S03", "Wait": 0}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 68, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "1.5"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 70, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "所以啊。<br>\n我就在那一瞬间，跳到了希罗身上。", "AuthorId": "Margo", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Trial13_Margo014"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 72, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "然后，我用藏起来的剑贯穿了梅露露的喉咙。", "AuthorId": "Margo", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Trial13_Margo015"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 74, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "那一刻梅露露露出了惊讶的表情……♡<br>\n实在太可爱了。", "AuthorId": "Margo", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Trial13_Margo016"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 76, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "接着，我用涂了毒药的剑刃<br>\n重复刺向梅露露。", "AuthorId": "Margo", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Trial13_Margo017"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 78, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "一下又一下……不停地刺。", "AuthorId": "Margo", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Trial13_Margo018"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 80, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "……啊，对了，那时候<br>\n梅露露拿着的瓶子摔碎了。", "AuthorId": "Margo", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Trial13_Margo019"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 82, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "所以我赶忙用反相位的声音抵消了玻璃破碎声。", "AuthorId": "Margo", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Trial13_Margo020"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 84, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "……其实在来监牢之前，<br>\n我就对这个魔法能做到什么程度很感兴趣，一直有在练习。", "AuthorId": "Margo", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Trial13_Margo021"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 86, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "所以我有自信，就算她发出一些尖叫声，我也能用魔法消除……", "AuthorId": "Margo", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Trial13_Margo022"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 88, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "不过，玻璃瓶破碎的声音倒是出乎我的意料，<br>\n没能完全消除掉。", "AuthorId": "Margo", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Trial13_Margo023"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 90, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "……看来蕾雅不愧是演舞台剧的，<br>\n耳朵真灵♡", "AuthorId": "Margo", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Trial13_Margo024"]}},
    {"op": "ResetText", "line": 92, "indent": 0, "params": {}},
    {"op": "DestroySpawnedExtended", "line": 93, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "Reenact_Ch02_E01_S03", "Wait": 0, "LogWarning": 1}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 94, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "1.5"}},
    {"op": "SpawnExtended", "line": 98, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "Reenact_Ch02_E01_S04", "Wait": 0}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 99, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "1.5"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 101, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "刺死梅露露之后，<br>\n我拿走了她的手机，离开了房间。", "AuthorId": "Margo", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Trial13_Margo025"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 103, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "之后，为了制造不在场证明，<br>\n我用梅露露的手机给艾玛打了电话。", "AuthorId": "Margo", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Trial13_Margo026"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 105, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "我的演技……很棒吧？", "AuthorId": "Margo", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Trial13_Margo027"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 107, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "当然，我没想到奈叶香会出现在医务室。", "AuthorId": "Margo", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Trial13_Margo028"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 109, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "之后我就立刻去会客厅和大家汇合了。<br>\n我原以为我的不在场证明已经伪造好了。", "AuthorId": "Margo", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Trial13_Margo029"]}},
    {"op": "ResetText", "line": 111, "indent": 0, "params": {}},
    {"op": "DestroySpawnedExtended", "line": 112, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "Reenact_Ch02_E01_S04", "Wait": 0, "LogWarning": 1}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 113, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "1.5"}},
    {"op": "SpawnExtended", "line": 118, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "Reenact_Ch02_E01_S05", "Wait": 0}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 119, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "1.5"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 121, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "只是想被人发现的时候，却偏偏没人发现……<br>\n人生就是这么变化无常。", "AuthorId": "Margo", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Trial13_Margo030"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 123, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "明明我等了好些时间，制造好了不在场证明，<br>\n梅露露的尸体却迟迟没有被人发现。", "AuthorId": "Margo", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Trial13_Margo031"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 125, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "所以……在和奈叶香一起回到房间后，<br>\n我决定制造出声音。", "AuthorId": "Margo", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Trial13_Margo032"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 127, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "如果再继续拖下去，<br>\n我精心策划的不在场证明<br>\n说不定就失去意义了。", "AuthorId": "Margo", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Trial13_Margo033"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 129, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "因此……我调整好魔法，发出了玻璃破碎的声音，<br>\n让声音听起来像是从尸体所在的房间里传出来一般。", "AuthorId": "Margo", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Trial13_Margo034"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 131, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "……用的就是【模仿】魔法哦。", "AuthorId": "Margo", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Trial13_Margo035"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 133, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "然后我和大家一起<br>\n发现了尸体和希罗。", "AuthorId": "Margo", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Trial13_Margo036"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 135, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "也是在那时候，我把梅露露的手机<br>\n塞到了希罗的衣服里。", "AuthorId": "Margo", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Trial13_Margo037"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 137, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "趁着大家都被尸体吸引了注意力，<br>\n我就装作关心希罗的样子，把梅露露的手机塞进了她的衣服里。", "AuthorId": "Margo", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Trial13_Margo038"]}},
    {"op": "ResetText", "line": 139, "indent": 0, "params": {}},
    {"op": "DestroySpawnedExtended", "line": 140, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "Reenact_Ch02_E01_S05", "Wait": 0, "LogWarning": 1}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 141, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "1.5"}},
    {"op": "SpawnExtended", "line": 144, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "Reenact_Ch02_E01_S01", "Wait": 0}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 145, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "1.5"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 147, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "我的故事……到这里就结束了。<br>\n怎么样？<br>\n是不是很有趣？", "AuthorId": "Margo", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Trial13_Margo039"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 149, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "……但是。", "AuthorId": "Margo", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Trial13_Margo040"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 151, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "现在回想起来，当时我的所感所思<br>\n究竟是不是真实的呢……<br>\n连我自己也搞不清楚了。", "AuthorId": "Margo", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Trial13_Margo041"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 153, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "这是一个骗子——<br>\n一个不可靠的叙述者，<br>\n所讲述的不可信的故事。", "AuthorId": "Margo", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Trial13_Margo042"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 155, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "你们是否愿意相信这种无稽之谈，就由你们自己判断好了。", "AuthorId": "Margo", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Trial13_Margo043"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 157, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "你们会觉得，我说的这些话……<br>\n是真的吗？", "AuthorId": "Margo", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Trial13_Margo044"]}},
    {"op": "ResetText", "line": 159, "indent": 0, "params": {}},
    {"op": "DestroySpawnedExtended", "line": 160, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "Reenact_Ch02_E01_S01", "Wait": 0, "LogWarning": 1}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 161, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "0.5"}},
    {"op": "SetCustomVariable", "line": 163, "indent": 0, "params": {"Expression": "isReenact = false"}},
    {"op": "Gosub", "line": 164, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "System/System_Subroutine.EndAdv"}},
    {"op": "GotoModified", "line": 166, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "Act02_Chapter01/Act02_Chapter01_Adv26", "SoftReset": 1}}
  ],
  "translations": {
  "0201Trial13_Margo001": "因为她太美好了。<br>\n闪耀夺目，温暖人心……",
  "0201Trial13_Margo002": "所以啊……我就杀了她。<br>\n仅此而已。……就是这么一回事。",
  "0201Trial13_Margo003": "至于杀害她的方法……<br>\n我是从可可的语音备忘录里得知的。",
  "0201Trial13_Margo004": "这座监牢的地下保险箱里，<br>\n存放着能杀死魔女的药物，还有能用作凶器的武器。",
  "0201Trial13_Margo005": "所以我就把那些东西拿走了。<br>\n因为那里根本没人看管，只要知道打开保险箱的方法，<br>\n一切都轻而易举。",
  "0201Trial13_Margo006": "不过，谁知道会发生什么呢。<br>\n说不定会被典狱长或者看守阻挠。",
  "0201Trial13_Margo007": "为了发泄我心中郁积的这份情感，<br>\n我想要做好万全的准备。",
  "0201Trial13_Margo008": "首先，我把希罗打昏了。<br>\n我用手套装着从中庭里挖来的沙子，<br>\n朝着她的后脑勺狠狠地来了一下……",
  "0201Trial13_Margo009": "不过跟虚构作品的情节不同，那样做<br>\n有可能直接导致她死亡……",
  "0201Trial13_Margo010": "不过，那已经无所谓了。",
  "0201Trial13_Margo011": "如此将身处诺亚房间内的希罗打晕之后……<br>\n我就喊梅露露过来了。",
  "0201Trial13_Margo012": "我跟她说希罗倒下了，她就立刻赶来了。<br>\n多么善良的好孩子啊……♡",
  "0201Trial13_Margo013": "梅露露一看到希罗，<br>\n就立刻跑到她身边了。",
  "0201Trial13_Margo014": "所以啊。<br>\n我就在那一瞬间，跳到了希罗身上。",
  "0201Trial13_Margo015": "然后，我用藏起来的剑贯穿了梅露露的喉咙。",
  "0201Trial13_Margo016": "那一刻梅露露露出了惊讶的表情……♡<br>\n实在太可爱了。",
  "0201Trial13_Margo017": "接着，我用涂了毒药的剑刃<br>\n重复刺向梅露露。",
  "0201Trial13_Margo018": "一下又一下……不停地刺。",
  "0201Trial13_Margo019": "……啊，对了，那时候<br>\n梅露露拿着的瓶子摔碎了。",
  "0201Trial13_Margo020": "所以我赶忙用反相位的声音抵消了玻璃破碎声。",
  "0201Trial13_Margo021": "……其实在来监牢之前，<br>\n我就对这个魔法能做到什么程度很感兴趣，一直有在练习。",
  "0201Trial13_Margo022": "所以我有自信，就算她发出一些尖叫声，我也能用魔法消除……",
  "0201Trial13_Margo023": "不过，玻璃瓶破碎的声音倒是出乎我的意料，<br>\n没能完全消除掉。",
  "0201Trial13_Margo024": "……看来蕾雅不愧是演舞台剧的，<br>\n耳朵真灵♡",
  "0201Trial13_Margo025": "刺死梅露露之后，<br>\n我拿走了她的手机，离开了房间。",
  "0201Trial13_Margo026": "之后，为了制造不在场证明，<br>\n我用梅露露的手机给艾玛打了电话。",
  "0201Trial13_Margo027": "我的演技……很棒吧？",
  "0201Trial13_Margo028": "当然，我没想到奈叶香会出现在医务室。",
  "0201Trial13_Margo029": "之后我就立刻去会客厅和大家汇合了。<br>\n我原以为我的不在场证明已经伪造好了。",
  "0201Trial13_Margo030": "只是想被人发现的时候，却偏偏没人发现……<br>\n人生就是这么变化无常。",
  "0201Trial13_Margo031": "明明我等了好些时间，制造好了不在场证明，<br>\n梅露露的尸体却迟迟没有被人发现。",
  "0201Trial13_Margo032": "所以……在和奈叶香一起回到房间后，<br>\n我决定制造出声音。",
  "0201Trial13_Margo033": "如果再继续拖下去，<br>\n我精心策划的不在场证明<br>\n说不定就失去意义了。",
  "0201Trial13_Margo034": "因此……我调整好魔法，发出了玻璃破碎的声音，<br>\n让声音听起来像是从尸体所在的房间里传出来一般。",
  "0201Trial13_Margo035": "……用的就是【模仿】魔法哦。",
  "0201Trial13_Margo036": "然后我和大家一起<br>\n发现了尸体和希罗。",
  "0201Trial13_Margo037": "也是在那时候，我把梅露露的手机<br>\n塞到了希罗的衣服里。",
  "0201Trial13_Margo038": "趁着大家都被尸体吸引了注意力，<br>\n我就装作关心希罗的样子，把梅露露的手机塞进了她的衣服里。",
  "0201Trial13_Margo039": "我的故事……到这里就结束了。<br>\n怎么样？<br>\n是不是很有趣？",
  "0201Trial13_Margo040": "……但是。",
  "0201Trial13_Margo041": "现在回想起来，当时我的所感所思<br>\n究竟是不是真实的呢……<br>\n连我自己也搞不清楚了。",
  "0201Trial13_Margo042": "这是一个骗子——<br>\n一个不可靠的叙述者，<br>\n所讲述的不可信的故事。",
  "0201Trial13_Margo043": "你们是否愿意相信这种无稽之谈，就由你们自己判断好了。",
  "0201Trial13_Margo044": "你们会觉得，我说的这些话……<br>\n是真的吗？"
}
}
